OL,3,GNEWSAMan badly injured in street       
OL,4,Aassault dies                           
OL,6,FA man who was seriously injured in an  
OL,7,Falleged assault in Halifax has died in 
OL,8,Fhospital, police said.                 
OL,10,FHaji Asghar Ali, 62, died on Saturday  
OL,11,Fevening following the incident on      
OL,12,FGibbet Street on Tuesday, West         
OL,13,FYorkshire Police confirmed.            
OL,15,FAwais Haroon, 35, from Halifax, was    
OL,16,Fcharged on Thursday with offences      
OL,17,Fincluding wounding with intent and     
OL,18,Fappeared before Bradford magistrates.  
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
