OL,3,GNEWSAMan badly injured in street       
OL,4,Aassault dies                           
OL,6,FPolice said the victim's death would be
OL,7,Faddressed during Haroon's scheduled    
OL,8,Fappearance at Bradford Crown Court on  
OL,9,F17 December. Haroon has been remanded  
OL,10,Finto custody until the appearance.     
